// BowerSecurityEvents: one row per Bower event, with delivery replays collapsed.
// Bower delivers at least once. An ambiguous Logs Ingestion acknowledgement (the upload
// was accepted but the response was lost), a restored queue backup or a dead-letter
// replay re-sends the queued row unchanged, so BowerSecurity_CL holds more than one row
// for the same (CollectorId, EventId). Archive replay through another collector
// receives that collector's ID and is counted separately. Replay labels are
// producer-controlled and must not change the identity used by detections.
// The first copy is kept within each stamped collector and event identity.
//   BowerFirstIngested      ingestion_time() of the first copy. Detections use it to
//                           identify when a late event first arrived; scheduled alerts
//                           may still repeat when evaluations or alert visibility lag.
//   BowerLastIngested       ingestion_time() of the latest copy.
//   BowerCopies             rows that share the identity (1 = no replay).
//   BowerEventTime          the event time Bower sent. Azure Monitor rewrites TimeGenerated
//                           to the receive time when it is more than two days old; the
//                           original survives in RawEnvelope.timeGenerated.
//   BowerTimeRewritten      true when TimeGenerated no longer equals the sent event time.
// The caller's time range still filters TimeGenerated. All copies of an event share
// TimeGenerated unless Azure rewrote it, so a range keeps or drops them together.
// Count events with count() after this function, never dcount() on the raw table:
// dcount() is an estimate.
BowerSecurity_CL
| extend BowerIngested = ingestion_time()
| summarize arg_min(BowerIngested, *), BowerLastIngested = max(BowerIngested), BowerCopies = count()
    by CollectorId, EventId
| project-rename BowerFirstIngested = BowerIngested
| extend BowerEventTime = coalesce(todatetime(RawEnvelope.timeGenerated), TimeGenerated)
| extend BowerTimeRewritten = BowerEventTime != TimeGenerated
